#: ../../../genex/TARGET_IMPORT_FILE.rst:17
msgid ""
"Full path to the linker import file. On DLL platforms, it would be the "
"``.lib`` file. For executables on AIX, and for shared libraries on macOS, it "
"could be, respectively, the ``.imp`` or ``.tbd`` import file, depending on "
"the value of the :prop_tgt:`ENABLE_EXPORTS` property."
msgstr ""

